[{"answer":"So how are you getting on with your teaching practice at the High School, Joe?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Well I've been put in charge of the school marching band, and it's quite a responsibility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to talk it over with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Go ahead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/4.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd better start by giving me a bit of background.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/5.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well the band has students in it from all years,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/7.mp3"},{"answer":"so they're aged 11 to 18, and there are about 50 of them altogether.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite a popular activity within the school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never worked with a band of more than 20 before, and this is very different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I can imagine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/11.mp3"},{"answer":"They aren't really good enough to enter national band competitions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're in a regional one later in the term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Even if they don't win, and I don't expect them to,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/14.mp3"},{"answer":"hopefully it'll be an incentive for them to try and improve.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, hopefully.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, now the town council's organising a carnival in the summer,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and the band has been asked to perform.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/18.mp3"},{"answer":"If you ask me, they aren't really up to it yet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and I need to get them functioning better as a band, and in a very short time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you been doing anything with them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Apart from practising the music, I mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I played a recording I came across,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/23.mp3"},{"answer":"of a drummer talking about how playing in a band had changed his life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it was an after-dinner speech.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it was pretty inspiring,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/26.mp3"},{"answer":"because being in the band had stopped him from getting involved in crime.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/27.mp3"},{"answer":"The students seemed to find it interesting, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm planning to show them that old film from the 1940s 'Strike Up the Band',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and talk about it with the students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/31.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/33.mp3"},{"answer":"As it's about a school band, it might make the students realise how much they can achieve if they work together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/34.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what I've got in mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm hoping I can take some of the band to a parade that's going to take place next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/36.mp3"},{"answer":"A couple of marching bands will be performing, and the atmosphere should be quite exciting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It depends on whether I can persuade the school to hire a coach or two to take us there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/38.mp3"},{"answer":"They sound like good ideas to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I tell you about a few people in the band who I'm finding it quite difficult to cope with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you'll have some ideas about what I can do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Go ahead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/43.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a flautist who says she loves playing in the band.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/44.mp3"},{"answer":"We rehearse twice a week after school, but she's hardly ever there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Then she looks for me the next day and gives me a very plausible reason -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/46.mp3"},{"answer":"she says she had to help her mother, or she's been ill,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but to be honest, I don't believe her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh dear!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Any more students with difficulties?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Plenty!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/51.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a trumpeter who thinks she's the best musician in the band, though she certainly isn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/52.mp3"},{"answer":"She's always saying what she thinks other people should do, which makes my job pretty difficult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/53.mp3"},{"answer":"She sounds a bit of a nightmare!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/54.mp3"},{"answer":"You can say that again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... one of the trombonists has got an impressive sense of rhythm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and could be an excellent musician -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/57.mp3"},{"answer":"except that he has breathing difficulties,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and he doesn't really have enough breath for the trombone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/59.mp3"},{"answer":"He'd be much better off playing percussion, for instance, but he refuses to give up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/60.mp3"},{"answer":"So he ends up only playing half the notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose you have to admire his determination.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/63.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the percussionists isn't too bad,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/64.mp3"},{"answer":"but he never seems to interact with other people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and he always rushes off as soon as the rehearsal ends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know if there are family reasons, or what.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/67.mp3"},{"answer":"But it isn't good in a band, where people really need to feel they're part of a group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/68.mp3"},{"answer":"There are others too, but at least that gives you an idea of what I'm up against.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any thoughts about what I can do, Lizzie?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-3-2023-02-02-11-25-43/70.mp3"}]
